      <div class="track-title">Enlightenment & Industrial Polymaths</div>
      <div class="track-sub">The age of reason and revolution. As disciplines began to formalize and specialize, these polymaths refused to stay in their lanes. They moved between pure mathematics, experimental physics, politics, engineering, and computing -- showing that cross-pollination drives breakthrough.</div>
